Z||000035||artherd||11-18-2001||06:42 PM||||Heh, I wasn't going to post, but ...<P>3.1415926535897932386683279502884197169399<P>Yay, I've got 10 digits on Cliff!  (of course, I don't speak Dutch worth a darned. And I bet his Fiero is faster...)<P>You are what you type on the Internet, and while I do not bother spell-checking any of my posts/emails (spell checking time can be purchased from me at the nominal rate of $275/hour.) I *DO* make an effort to simply communicate clearly.<P>I refuse to concatonate the non-word 'you' into more of a non-word 'u' or anything so rediculas.  PS: I don't know how to spell rediculas off the top of my head.  Yes, I'm partially lysdexic (I am Dyslexic of Borg, your Ass Will be Laminated!)  However, I know where the shift key is, and YOU get the idea of my posts in the end.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Which is more than I can say than from some posts I read on this fourm as of late  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Those I simply ignore, as I suspect others do, and the poster has a much smaller audience for whatever their question or point may have been.  In short, it's your loss, guys.  Try and talk a little more better?<BR>Best!<BR>Ben<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B> "l337 741k" = "Leet talk" = "Elite talk"<P>Apparantly, you are the king if you can write words using anything [b]but</B> the original 26 characters from the alphabet.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>I don't know - maybe I'm just turning into a dinosaur but in my highschool days, it was cool if you could recite something from Shakespeare or if you knew Pi in more than 30 decimals (3.14159265358979323846264338327950288 - I still know that by heart, hope I still got it right though   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
