Z||000053||LZeitgeist||11-19-2001||03:25 PM||||Buttah - :lol Why yes, ah does spek fluint Hill-billay... nicetameetcha...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>falconhulk writes:<BR>If you cant get the point edit the post and make it legible. Other then that dont be so anal.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank you for illustrating my point perfectly. If the writer doesn't care about the message enough to make it legible, why should the reader be forced to take on the responsibility of making it comprehensible?<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000054||falconhulk||11-19-2001||03:39 PM||||"Buttah - :lol Why yes, ah does spek fluint Hill-billay... nicetameetcha...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Thank you for illustrating my point perfectly. If the writer doesn't care about the message enough to make it legible, why should the reader be forced to take on the responsibility of making it comprehensible?"<P><BR>I would igore a post LIKE "Buttah - :lol Why yes, ah does spek fluint Hill-billay... nicetameetcha...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">" Well actually I would laugh at it first!  I think that this post is probably directed to one person in particular, and maybe a few others to a lesser extent.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000055||Butter||11-19-2001||04:16 PM||||LZeitgeist,<BR>How be the sun shine where you at.  It be rainin' like bessy pn ona flat rock at the end of indjuin sumer roun here.<P>Trans lated for the Hillbilly impaired:<BR>The weather is commonly accepted for setting up proper protocol between two Hillbillies.  I was asking for a weather report, attitude check, and insight on the person in the first sentence.  In the second sentence I was giving a weather report (raining medium hard), forecast for my area (warm beginning to turn cold) and from this we can get a bearing where on the globe we are as all good Hillbillies keep up with the weather and signs.  <P>Hillbilly 101  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif"> <P><BR>||||reg||7
Z||000056||JSocha||11-19-2001||04:41 PM||||Man!  I just hope that this "anal retentive" attitude everyone seems to have regarding grammer/spelling and the like doesn't last through the holidays.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I hope everyone takes a deep breath and lets it loose before then on the john, otherwise it is going to be awful shi...cra...poopy around here.<P>Me, I could care less how anybody else spells, enunciates their words here, types their sentences grammer wise, yada, yada, yada...<P>Some people are lax here. Me especially.  Others are more then likely using two fingers to type and others are just in a hurry to get their post in before somebody beats them to the punch line if there is one there, to get to other threads or for what ever reason.  I don't get critical of how they type.  I get a good laugh from some of them.<P>We already had one person running amuck around here acting as a self proclaimed "College English Professor", being critical of the way everybody would convey a message by ostrasizing them as if being graded for every little spelling and gramatical error they had made within a post for the sole purpose of trying to make that persons argument less valid and his much more superior.<P>If you are going to engage in the art of polemics and this is the method you use to refute arguments through acts or methods such as these as contention to your argument, then, in my opinion you have already lost.||||reg||8
Z||000057||LZeitgeist||11-19-2001||04:42 PM||||Please forgive me - I believed when I sent the post in two sections, separated by a quote, that it would be understood that the first part was addressed specifically to "Buttah" <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  and the part after the quoted text would be addressed to the individual quoted.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>The above post *should* have read as follows:<P>----------------------<P><B>Buttah:</B> - :lol Why yes, ah does spek fluint Hill-billay... nicetameetcha...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR><B>falconhulk:</B> you wrote:<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>If you cant get the point edit the post and make it legible. Other then that dont be so anal.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Falconhulk, thank you for illustrating my point perfectly. In my way of thinking, if the writer doesn't care about the message enough to make it legible, why should the reader be forced to take on the responsibility of making it comprehensible?<P>-------------<P>Apologies for the confusion... but it also illustrates how imprecise writing techniques lead to misunderstandings.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>O.K., I think I've had my fun in this thread... have at it, y'all!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000058||JSocha||11-19-2001||04:50 PM||||<B>PS</B>  I myself have been out of High School for over 15 years and out of college almost 12 years now.<P>Therefore, I am not here handing in an essay, paper or the like for somebody else to grade on my bad punctuation, grammer, spelling or anything else related to "Graded" communication.<P>I am here to meet people, interact, get to know you and your Fiero's, have a good time, etc (PERIOD--&gt; <FONT SIZE="3"><B>.</B></FONT>)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000059||LZeitgeist||11-19-2001||04:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>If you are going to engage in the art of polemics and this is the method you use to refute arguments through acts or methods such as these as contention to your argument, then, in my opinion you have already lost.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>JSocha - when did this become a fight or a competition? Seems like a relatively easy-going discussion to me... I'm refuting nothing that has been said - I'm attempting to understand and be understood.<P>The crux of what I'm saying is simply this - why is it such an evil concept to hope that people, if they desire others to take in and comprehend the message they're conveying, will take an extra couple of seconds here and there to make sure their message is clear? Also - why does it appear that 'learning' and expanding one's abilities just the <B>slightest</B> bit is such an unreasonable hope? ||||reg||1
Z||000060||Butter||11-19-2001||05:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JSocha:<BR><B>I am here to meet people, interact, get to know you and your Fiero's, have a good time, etc (PERIOD--&gt; <FONT SIZE="3">[b].</B></FONT>)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>No I wasn't trying to be anal. It truly was in fun.  I was just trying to have a little fun with that other language and show how communications can be distorted, shortened or even coded.<BR>OK I'll reassess the situation and discontinue the  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> ASAP.<P>Love that signin' stuff.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000061||JSocha||11-19-2001||05:49 PM||||I was just sharing my opinion or perspective LZ on the topic at hand.  I know its been friendly.  Something we have had the pleasure of all enjoying lately without serious arguments (albeit the religious threads   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> )<P>And thank you for helping me show another point seemingly not considered or observed.  Even with semi-perfect grammar, punctuation, spelling, one still can be misunderstood.  I was hoping somebody would bite on the bait.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>OH!  And Mach10! Please git your arse out of my Daisy Field before I gits the shotgun!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 11-19-2001).]||||reg||6
