Z||000064||Return of Fiero||11-20-2001||01:30 PM||||OK, it was enevitable, you all knew i HAD to give my 2 cents, (or in most cases, 2 bucks) because I am FULL of opinions.<BR> <BR>problem 1:<BR>along the lines, someone said "wasted money on education." was that cliff? regaurdless, i have stated this may times before, i am NO spelling ace, nor do i attempt to be one. i never spell check any of my post, as you have all seen. why? simple, i dont have to hide my faults, you dont like my faults, then kiss my butt, because it bothers me NONE if you dont like my faults. as much as my strengths, they make me Myke. i like my faults, they are part of who i am. i would rather be me, and do MY best at everything i try my hand at. did i grow up in the USA? hell yeah, did i take any interest in english courses? hell no. i spent my time with history, law, phycology, elecrtonics, and business. did my lack of gramatical skills or spelling edicate force my life sytle to suffer? hell no. i speak very eliquently when i feel like it, and its not forced. can i spell elequint? it willbe a cold day in hell if i do.also, my vocabulary holds more words than most collage graduates, but can i spell them? no. can i use them in a sentance, and make them function? hell yeah. am i mocking this whole topic due to the fact that it is beneith all of us to give a crap who likes our spelling? DAMN SKIPPY!!!!! any how, to make my point on problem one. with the degrees and schooling i have had, i can change jobs, and job feilds when i please, and still make some decent cash. hey, i own a business, and im growing tired of it, and looking into a new carrer. still, my spelling is atroshus (that i did on purpose). my education, and $ for it, were well spent.<P>problem 2:<BR>I TYPE LOOKING AT MY KEYBOARD, and like to use caps to get attention.i can type faily quickly looking at my keyboard, as i know where all my keys are. can i type from home row and look at the screen? yeah, if i wanted to take 3 times as long, but i have a business, and dont have timne to be thumbing out keys, when i have to worry about who is screwing up what car, and what car i have to fix next. thank you, but no thanks, ill takethe occational slip, as my post tend to be easily read.<P>problem 3:<BR>we decided to single people out. nothing like saying "not that im singling anyone out, but so-and-so, you suck with the posts" come one, joke or no joke, thats a bit of weight to lay on someone.<P>problem 4:<BR>the fact that we cant be happy to read from another person, see there point, and let there short comings slide. why should we care if my spelling sux? who cares if i shorten a word like sucks? you know what sux means, even if it sux that its not writen sux. am i mocking? yep, have to do it,or rather, gots to do it. make you mad to see "gots"? get over it, if you let little things like spelling and gramer get you down, what do you do when the neighbors dog pi$$es on you lawn? do you shoot the dog?what do you do to the guy who bumps you in the hall? do yuo turn around and punch him out? What happens when you go to McD's and ask for no pickels and you get pickels? do you shove the guy in the fry vat? there are many minor things in the world to piss you off, and less major things. worry about the major things, and you will have less stress.<P>problem 5:<BR>i dont like to use punctuation. i use as little as posible. you can still understand me if i dont write "don't".<P>in closing (thank god, right?) i have not seen one post i couldnt decifer at first glance. if your not up to par, ask questions, its a good way to learn. remeber school? i know it was a while ago, but we asked questions to get answers. thats life!!<BR>am i  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">evil <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"> yeah, maybe but hey, enjoy,<P>Myke<BR>ps, i dont spell my name incorectly :P||||reg||1
